<h1>SolarEdge Site Connected</h1>

<div class="s-3"></div>
<p>
  Consent has been given for us to access data for the SolarEdge monitoring system with
  site id <%= @installation.site_id %> for <%= @installation.school.name %>
</p>

<div class="s-3"></div>
<% if @installation.created_at.today? %>
  <p>
    This is a newly created SolarEdge site. You will need to review the configuration and complete setup for the
    school.
  </p>
<% else %>
  <p>
    This is an existing SolarEdge site which we can now access via the new SolarEdge API.
  </p>
<% end %>

<div class="s-3"></div>
<p>
  <%= link_to 'View solar feeds', school_solar_feeds_configuration_index_url(@installation.school) %>
</p>
